  -> P2b/P3 HOLD: the penalty PLATEAUS for a slow upstream, turns at ratio ~ 1 -- where the upstream correlation time meets the downstream response time -- and falls by motional narrowing above it. The crossover is not an adjustable feature: it sits at equal timescales

